 action required.\n52\t- On a non-entitled cluster, Llama Stack management surfaces are not shown,\n53\t  with no errors or broken navigation.\n54\t- The default-on behavior can be reverted to disabled via the existing\n55\t  feature-flag configuration (OdhDashboardConfig) without a code change.\n56\t- The management surfaces render correctly against the current\n57\t  LlamaStackDistribution CR surface (list, status, and detail views).\n58\t\n59\t## HLR Traceability\n60\t\n61\t- **HLR-5 (P1)**: the Dashboard enables Llama Stack management by default for\n62\t  entitled clusters (no TP opt-in gate) — delivered by this epic.\n63\t\n64\t## Risks / Notes\n65\t\n66\t- Because this change replaces the existing opt-in behavior, a rollback path\n67\t  is required and captured as an acceptance criterion above (feature-flag\n68\t  revert).\n69\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-98b340ca48b046e4","agent_id":"a8981028e057760d0","session_id":"71dcbc61-9434-456e-a363-a4d82acc6903","uuid":"46c3df22-1e79-49e5-9451-535b8b950a0b","timestamp":"2026-10-25T20:20:49.684Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bc44722eb3672b37","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
