ported\n53\t    configuration path.\n54\t  - The Dashboard management experience enabled by default for entitled\n55\t    clusters.\n56\t- Author the migration notes from Tech Preview:\n57\t  - The tested upgrade path from the last two TP releases, including any\n58\t    documented incompatibilities and workarounds.\n59\t  - The opt-in-to-default Dashboard enablement change and what users see\n60\t    after upgrade.\n61\t  - Changes to the experimental status of formerly flagged integrations.\n62\t- Content outline:\n63\t  1. GA overview and support posture\n64\t  2. Installation and supported configurations\n65\t  3. API stability and versioning\n66\t  4. Upgrading from Tech Preview (migration guide)\n67\t  5. Safety guardrails (TrustyAI) configuration\n68\t  6. Dashboard management\n69\t\n70\t## Acceptance Criteria\n71\t\n72\t- Documentation for every element of the GA scope listed above is published\n73\t  and meets Red Hat GA documentation standards.\n74\t- Migration notes from TP are published, covering the tested upgrade path from\n75\t  the last two TP releases, the Dashboard default-on change, and formerly\n76\t  experimental integrations.\n77\t- All documentation is technically reviewed against the implemented GA\n78\t  behavior by engineering, with review evidence recorded.\n79\t\n80\t## HLR Traceability\n81\t\n82\t- **HLR-6 (P2)**: documentation uplifted to GA standards, including migration\n83\t  notes from TP — delivered by this epic.\n84\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-98b340ca48b046e4","agent_id":"a8981028e057760d0","session_id":"71dcbc61-9434-456e-a363-a4d82acc6903","uuid":"e00d9dfa-2805-42b8-b6cc-3722bc92f097","timestamp":"2026-10-25T20:20:50.303Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-838b1a70346d60db","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
